       "source": "PubMed",
       "id": "11089964"
      }
     ],
     "value": "Heterodimer with SRP14; binds RNA as heterodimer (By similarity). Component of a signal recognition particle complex that consists of a 7SL RNA molecule of 300 nucleotides and six protein subunits: SRP72, SRP68, SRP54, SRP19, SRP14 and SRP9 (PubMed:11089964)"
    }
   ],
